      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-10T19:42:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shooting at the main engine of a flying fortress - BAD.&nbsp; Using Blinding Speed to safely remove it from the premises - GOOD.&nbsp; (Flash Flood doesn't quite make sense, and Bio-Engineering Beam makes no sense at all, but still, the idea that you don't want to ATTACK a giant nuclear-or-whatever reactor is pretty grokkable.)</p>",
