      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-10T19:50:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Surely of all those examples, \"removing it from the premesis\" is actually the worst possible thing you can do, if you're looking at it thematically - \"Oh, where have the engines gone that are keeping thei thing in the air?\", \"It's okay, Tachyon just somehow moved them elsewhere so that we don't keep accidentally hitting them\", \"Oh...wait...so, what's keeping us in the air, again?\", \"Um...\" :D.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:15:53.956Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
