      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-10T19:55:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay I didn't think about your second point, but the first one, I wasn't saying that it made NO sense, just that it takes a little squinting.&nbsp; (My thought on Flash Flood was that it was reactor coolant, and on BEB that it was Omni selectively vaporizing the potential criticality and rebuilding it into control rods.)&nbsp; Either way, my main point stands...it makes perfect sense that you don't want to fire a Flak Cannon into the goddamn thing.</p>",
