      "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve used the same loophole to kill Apostate with Wrathful Gaze when he would normally flip due to relics.<br /><br />It&#39;s worth noting that Baron Blade is worded to flip &quot;when Baron Blade would be destroyed&quot;, so I&#39;m pretty sure the loophole is intentional.</p>",
